1
00:00:00,855 --> 00:00:03,485
I don't wanna look like an idiot.
I wanna blend in.

2
00:00:03,650 --> 00:00:04,980
If you wanna blend in...

3
00:00:05,151 --> 00:00:08,401
(Sheldon:)...I'd think looking like an idiot
would be the perfect camouflage.

4
00:00:09,322 --> 00:00:11,492
Sheldon, teach me football.
It'll be fun.

5
00:00:11,825 --> 00:00:14,665
(Sheldon:)That's exactly what my father said.

6
00:00:14,828 --> 00:00:16,708
"Come to the games.
Watch the games."

7
00:00:16,871 --> 00:00:19,211
(Sheldon:)Week in and week out,
from the time I was 5...

8
00:00:19,374 --> 00:00:23,624
(Sheldon:)...until I went off to college.
Longest seven years of my life.

9
00:00:24,462 --> 00:00:26,632
(Leonard:)Please, I'm asking you as a friend.

10
00:00:28,216 --> 00:00:31,756
(Sheldon:)Are you making this
a tier-one friendship request?

11
00:00:32,887 --> 00:00:36,137
(Howard:)-Yes.
-Fine.

12
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:38,770
(Leonard:)-I really appreciate this.
-Yeah, yeah.

13
00:00:38,935 --> 00:00:42,025
(Sheldon:)All right, poindexter,
sit down, shut up and listen.

14
00:00:43,356 --> 00:00:44,436
(Leonard:)I'm sorry?

15
00:00:44,608 --> 00:00:48,028
Oh, that's how my father
always began our football conversations.

16
00:00:48,486 --> 00:00:51,326
(Sheldon:)And if you'd like, after the game,
I'll teach you...

17
00:00:51,489 --> 00:01:17,039
(Sheldon:)...how to shoot close enough
to a raccoon that it craps itself.

